msgid ""
"title: Quickstart\n"
"description: A quickstart guide for the pauli-prop Qiskit addons package\n"
msgstr ""
"title: Quickstart\n"
"description: Panduan quickstart untuk paket Qiskit addons pauli-prop\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "In this guide we use the ``pauli-prop`` package to classically simulate the time dynamics of a 10-qubit kicked Ising model on a 1D spin chain.\n"
msgstr "Di panduan ini kita pakai paket ``pauli-prop`` untuk mensimulasikan secara klasik dinamika waktu model Ising yang di-kick 10-qubit pada rantai spin 1D.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Prepare the inputs for Pauli propagation {#prepare-the-inputs-for-pauli-propagation}"
msgstr "Siapkan input untuk Pauli propagation {#prepare-the-inputs-for-pauli-propagation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "The Hamiltonian considered is:\n"
msgstr "Hamiltonian yang dipakai adalah:\n"

# doq: copied, nothing translatable
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"
msgstr "$H = -J\\sum\\limits_{\\langle i,j \\rangle} Z_iZ_j + h\\sum\\limits_iX_i$\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "where $J>0$ describes the coupling of nearest-neighbor spins, $i<j$, and $h$ is the global transverse field. A first-order Trotter decomposition of the time-evolved operator will be implemented as a quantum circuit, $U$, over $20$ Trotter steps. The coupling constant, $J$, will be fixed at $J=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$, and $h$ will be fixed at $\\frac{\\pi}{6}$. The $ZZ$ interactions will be implemented using Clifford gates ($CX$, $Sdg$, $\\sqrt{Y}$).\n"
msgstr "dengan $J>0$ menggambarkan kopling antar spin tetangga terdekat, $i<j$, dan $h$ adalah medan transversal global. Dekomposisi Trotter orde pertama dari operator yang berevolusi waktu akan diimplementasikan sebagai circuit kuantum, $U$, selama $20$ langkah Trotter. Konstanta kopling, $J$, akan dibuat tetap di $J=-\\frac{\\pi}{2}$, dan $h$ dibuat tetap di $\\frac{\\pi}{6}$. Interaksi $ZZ$ akan diimplementasikan memakai gate Clifford ($CX$, $Sdg$, $\\sqrt{Y}$).\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "We implement the Trotterized time evolution as a quantum circuit and use $\\frac{\\pi}{6}$ for the non-Clifford rotations about the x-axis. The further these angles are from Clifford angles (for example, $\\theta=n\\frac{\\pi}{2}, n \\in \\mathbb{Z}$), the more difficult the system will be to simulate for Pauli propagation methods.\n"
msgstr "Kita implementasikan evolusi waktu Trotter sebagai circuit kuantum dan memakai $\\frac{\\pi}{6}$ untuk rotasi non-Clifford terhadap sumbu x. Makin jauh sudut-sudut ini dari sudut Clifford (misalnya $\\theta=n\\frac{\\pi}{2}, n \\in \\mathbb{Z}$), makin sulit sistemnya disimulasikan dengan metode Pauli propagation.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "For the choice of observable, we consider the average single-site magnetization, $\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\langle z_i \\rangle$, where $N$ is the number of spins.\n"
msgstr "Untuk pilihan observable, kita pakai magnetisasi rata-rata per situs, $\\frac{1}{N} \\sum_{i=1}^{N} \\langle z_i \\rangle$, dengan $N$ adalah jumlah spin.\n"

