msgstr "![Output of the previous code cell](/docs/images/addons/pauli-prop/guides/quickstart/extracted-outputs/15d5eccf-eef0-4435-b67a-98a8038c400e-0.avif)\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Title ##
#, no-wrap
msgid "Simulate the time evolution of the system with Pauli propagation {#simulate-the-time-evolution-of-the-system-with-pauli-propagation}"
msgstr "Simulasikan evolusi waktu sistem dengan Pauli propagation {#simulate-the-time-evolution-of-the-system-with-pauli-propagation}"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "Once we have our circuit, $U$, and observable, $O$, we can easily simulate the system in a few steps:\n"
msgstr "Setelah punya circuit, $U$, dan observable, $O$, kita bisa dengan mudah mensimulasikan sistemnya dalam beberapa langkah:\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Separate $U$, into its Clifford, $C$, and non-Clifford, $P$, parts such that $U=PC$ using ``evolve_through_cliffords``\n"
msgstr "Pisahkan $U$ menjadi bagian Clifford, $C$, dan non-Clifford, $P$, sehingga $U=PC$ memakai ``evolve_through_cliffords``\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Propagate $O$ through $P$, resulting in a new operator, $O^\\prime$, using ``pauli_prop.propagate_through_circuit``\n"
msgstr "Propagasikan $O$ melalui $P$, menghasilkan operator baru, $O^\\prime$, memakai ``pauli_prop.propagate_through_circuit``\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Evolve $O^\\prime$ through the Clifford part of the circuit using the Clifford evolution support built into Qiskit\n"
msgstr "Evolusikan $O^\\prime$ melalui bagian Clifford dari circuit memakai dukungan evolusi Clifford yang sudah ada di Qiskit\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Bullet: '- '
#, no-wrap
msgid "Approximate the expectation value as $\\langle0|O^\\prime|0\\rangle \\approx \\langle0|U^\\dagger OU|0\\rangle$ by summing the coefficients in $O^\\prime$ associated with fully-diagonal Pauli terms (Pauli terms containing either ``I`` or ``Z`` on all qubits). Remember, this is an approximation because we truncated terms from $O^\\prime$ as we propagated it through the non-Clifford part of the circuit.\n"
msgstr "Aproksimasi nilai ekspektasi sebagai $\\langle0|O^\\prime|0\\rangle \\approx \\langle0|U^\\dagger OU|0\\rangle$ dengan menjumlahkan koefisien di $O^\\prime$ yang terkait suku Pauli yang sepenuhnya diagonal (suku Pauli yang berisi ``I`` atau ``Z`` pada semua qubit). Ingat, ini adalah aproksimasi karena kita memotong beberapa suku dari $O^\\prime$ saat mempropagasikannya melalui bagian non-Clifford dari circuit.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "As we run larger calculations, the expectation value approximations become more accurate. In this example, we saturate the full Pauli space at around $4^{10}\\approx10^6$, which is reflected in the curve flattening out between the final two points.\n"
msgstr "Makin besar perhitungan yang kita jalankan, makin akurat aproksimasi nilai ekspektasinya. Di contoh ini, kita menjenuhkan seluruh ruang Pauli di sekitar $4^{10}\\approx10^6$, yang terlihat dari kurva yang mendatar di antara dua titik terakhir.\n"

# doq: translated after an English change 2026-11-13
#. type: Plain text
#, no-wrap
msgid "While the plot below shows a monotonic convergence, Pauli propagation simulations do not generally converge monotonically. It is not unusual to see \"bumpy\" behavior in these types of plots.\n"
msgstr "Meski plot di bawah menunjukkan konvergensi monoton, simulasi Pauli propagation umumnya tidak konvergen secara monoton. Wajar kalau kita melihat perilaku \"bergelombang\" di plot jenis ini.\n"

